# Server (Nest)

- Nest 11 + Prisma 7 + Redis. Source under `server/src/`.
- Typed config via `registerAs` in `server/src/infrastructure/config/` — no secrets in code; use `.env` / `.env.example`.
- Database only through `PrismaService`; Redis through `RedisService`.
- Global API prefix `api`. Health: `GET /api/health`.
- Swagger: `server/src/infrastructure/swagger/setup-swagger.ts`. Document new endpoints with `@ApiTags` / `@ApiOperation`. Prod Basic Auth on docs/YAML when `NODE_ENV=production` (`SWAGGER_USER` / `SWAGGER_PASSWORD`).
- OpenAPI YAML: `/yaml`, `/ymal`, `/api/yaml`, `/api/ymal`.
- This API is **not** multi-tenant — do not reintroduce tenant context.
- Business guardrails: [`valentia-business.md`](../../valentia-business.md) + skill `nestjs-patterns` (payment gates, RBAC, audit ≠ activity timeline, no double booking, AI non-authority, data-trust precedence).

